{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up in a strange, unfamiliar place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Aim for the horizon...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious voice echoes in your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First things first: take a leap of faith.</strong><br>Yes\u2014<strong>jump off the base.</strong><br>That\u2019s where the real journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry. No broken ankles. Promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif001.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Just go. As far as you can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies start to appear once you\u2019ve left the base behind.<br>Each time you die and return, the map and weather shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the weather, different enemies show up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies will sometimes reward you with materials\u2014<br>and what you get depends on the type of enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 Hint:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sunny daytime is your best bet.<br>Find a <strong>Stone Golem</strong>, defeat it, and use the material it drops to craft your first tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif002.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif004.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s how the building begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemies?<br>Well\u2026 they\u2019re a little shy.<br>They might run away before you land a hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think of it like fishing.<br>Every encounter is rare.<br>Sometimes, you\u2019ll come back empty-handed.<br>That\u2019s okay.<br><strong>Try again tomorrow\u2014maybe it\u2019ll be a big haul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn which enemies appear in which weather, and what they drop.<br>Don\u2019t just rush in blindly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif005.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the terrain that gives <strong>you</strong> the upper hand\u2014and strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up an <strong>alchemy desk</strong> and start your <strong>fields</strong>.<br>Grow vegetables. Improve breeds. Evolve your harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif006-2.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif007.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eat what you grow. Feel yourself getting stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no telling what kind of upgrades your crops will bring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif009.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a large number of disposal sites and automated drones and aim for the dream of a passive income life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif008.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wise person once said:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;If you want to go far, just build a pole creator.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/extras/spmflgif003.gif?t=1750561919\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3495500?t=1750561919","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750561919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/f2882993c262d16b748247cc9b0534ef06ac07ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750561919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495500/f2882993c262d16b748247cc9b0534ef06ac07ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750561919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3542840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You wake up in a strange, unfamiliar place.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Aim for the horizon...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious voice echoes in your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First things first: take a leap of faith.</strong><br>Yes\u2014<strong>jump off the base.</strong><br>That\u2019s where the real journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry. No broken ankles. Promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic